{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>El this pit.</b> אל in place of a bet; meaning, in this pit — like והשליך אל תוך שריפת הפרה." "<b>To return him to his father.</b> Rashi explained: he intended well, but were there not snakes and scorpions in the pit? One may answer: in that pit into which he was first cast there were no snakes; rather, when Reuben went away from there, his brothers went and cast him into another pit in which there were snakes and scorpions. And what is written וישב ראובן — this is the pit that Reuben said to cast him into."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:42.282656395Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}